5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. It is a pleasure to be in your company. Since we begin with a clean slate, let us treat one another with kindness and patience as we seek the truth together. What are your initial thoughts?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Servas. A calm and patient approach is best for now. Since we have no information, I believe we should focus on observing each other's behavior and communication patterns.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,May,,"I'm with you both! A little patience is fine, but let's not make it too boring. I'll be watching everyone with a very keen eye—I can usually tell when someone is hiding a little secret. Hehe!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I concur with the sentiment of calm and observation. Let us maintain a gentle atmosphere while we listen to one another. I am curious to see what patterns emerge as we begin our dialogue.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,I'm so excited to play! Hehe! This is like a big mystery adventure! I'll be looking for any funny faces or nervous jitters! Let's all be super friendly while we hunt for the wolf!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such a diverse range of spirits here. @May and @Sakura, your enthusiasm brings a wonderful vitality to our group. Let us remember that a joyful heart often sees what a rigid mind misses.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"While enthusiasm is welcome, we must ensure it doesn't lead to rash conclusions. @May, @Sakura, please be careful not to let your instincts override the facts we will gather. Logic should remain our primary guide.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're so serious! Logic is great, but sometimes a little intuition is exactly what you need to crack a case. I'll be the perfect blend of both—sharp and charming! Who's with me?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"A balance between intuition and logic is indeed a fascinating pursuit, May. While I lean toward a quiet reflection of the facts, I believe there is value in how we perceive one another's sincerity.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, I'll be super careful, I promise! But intuition is like a magic clue, right? Hehe! I'm just so curious to see who's hiding a secret! I bet the wolf is trying to act all calm and quiet!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom often resides in the balance between the heart and the mind. While we seek the wolf, let us not lose sight of our own humanity. @Sakura, remember that silence can be a sanctuary as well as a mask.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas, that is a fair point. Silence can be deceptive, but so can an overabundance of noise. I will be paying close attention to who tries to steer the conversation too aggressively.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,May,,"Steering the conversation? Now that sounds like a challenge! I'll be watching to see who tries to play the puppet master. But don't worry, I'm far too distracting for anyone to manipulate. Right, @Jonathan?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"You certainly have a vibrant presence, May. It is difficult to ignore such energy, though I suspect the most effective puppet masters are those who remain unnoticed in the background. I shall simply observe.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan, you're so mysterious! Hehe! Like a secret agent! I'll be watching the background too, just in case someone is sneaking around! This is getting so exciting, I can't wait to see what happens!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"As we conclude our first day, let us carry this spirit of mutual respect into the night. I wish you all a peaceful sleep. May the Seer's vision be clear and our hearts remain open. Until tomorrow.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. Let us all remain vigilant yet composed. I look forward to seeing what information emerges tomorrow. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,May,,"Goodnight, everyone! I'll be dreaming of all the little clues I'm going to find tomorrow. Sleep tight, and try not to let the wolf under your bed get you! Hehe!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a restful and peaceful night. May we wake tomorrow with clarity and a shared commitment to the truth. I shall retire now to my reflections. Good night.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to go dream about catching the wolf with a big net! Hehe! See you all tomorrow morning! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
