36,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all awoke feeling refreshed. The first night has passed, and the Seer now holds a spark of truth. I wonder, does anyone feel the time is right to share their findings?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"It is still very early. While the Seer's information is vital, revealing oneself now could be a dangerous risk. I believe we should first observe if any contradictions arise in our conversation before anyone claims a role.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,May,,"@Misaki, always so cautious! But where's the fun in waiting? If our Seer is feeling bold, I'd love to hear a little secret. Or maybe the wolf is already trying to blend in? I'm watching you all!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree with Misaki that caution is prudent. However, the Seer's insight is our most precious asset. If the Seer feels the village's safety is better served by speaking now, I would support that decision.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm awake! Hehe! I wonder if the Seer found a big, scary wolf already? @everyone, does anyone feel like they're acting a little bit different today? I'm watching you all very closely!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is natural to feel a shift in the air when the stakes become real. @Sakura, your curiosity is a gift, but let us be gentle with one another. @Seer, please know we trust your wisdom whenever you choose to speak.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas, trust is a fragile thing in this game. While we should be gentle, we must also be analytical. If the Seer remains silent, we must rely on our own observations of how everyone is reacting to the pressure.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're making this sound like a courtroom! Let's lighten up. If the Seer is staying quiet, maybe they're just playing hard to get? Or maybe they're scared of me! Hehe! Who's feeling the pressure, everyone?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Pressure can be a revealing mirror, May. It often exposes the cracks in a facade. While I find your energy refreshing, I believe we should focus on the silence between the words. Does anyone feel an unnatural hesitation?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan, you're so spooky! Hehe! ""Silence between the words"" sounds like a magic spell! I don't see any hesitation, but maybe the wolf is just really good at pretending to be a statue! Who do you think is the most suspicious?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Suspicion is a heavy burden to carry, Sakura. Let us not rush to cast it. Instead, let us listen to the rhythm of our voices. Does anyone feel that a certain harmony is being forced, or perhaps a truth is being hidden?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas, harmony can indeed be a mask. However, I am more concerned with those who try to deflect suspicion through excessive cheer or by pushing for a target without evidence. We must remain objective.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're practically accusing me of being a wolf just for having a personality! How boring. If we're looking for ""forced harmony,"" maybe we should look at the ones being *too* polite. Right, @Servas?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, politeness is not necessarily a mask, but your observation is a valid point of analysis. It is often the most seamless blends that hide the deepest secrets. I wonder if anyone here feels an urge to deflect.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@May, you're so funny! Hehe! But @Servas is just being a nice gentleman! Maybe the wolf is actually someone who's trying to be *too* smart and logical? Like a super-villain in a book! Does that make sense?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a gentle reminder that we are all human, regardless of our roles. @May, your playfulness is a light in this darkness, and @Sakura, your imagination is a treasure. Let us vote with a clear heart.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"Since no one has claimed the Seer role and no clear contradictions have emerged, we are in a difficult position. I suggest we avoid a rash execution based on ""vibes"" and instead vote carefully. Who do you all suspect?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're the one who always talks about logic, yet you're the one suggesting we just ""vote carefully"" without a lead! How convenient. I'm leaning towards someone who's a bit too polished. @Servas, you're awfully sweet, almost too sweet! Hehe!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a delicate moment. While May's intuition is spirited, we must be wary of casting suspicion without a foundation. However, if we must choose, I find the lack of a Seer's claim most unsettling. I shall vote with caution.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, this is so hard! Everyone is being so nice! But @May said @Servas is too sweet... that is a little bit spooky, right? Hehe! I don't want to pick the wrong person, but I'll just follow my detective heart!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
