69,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It is a tragedy that we lost Servas, and the attack on Jonathan is equally distressing. We must now analyze these results. If Servas was the werewolf, the attack on Jonathan would be impossible. This means the wolf is still among us.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,May,,"Wait, Jonathan got attacked? That's a huge clue! It means the wolf is definitely still here and playing a very dangerous game. Poor Servas... I guess he really was just a sweet soul after all. Who's next on my list? Hehe!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh no! Jonathan is gone too?! This is getting really scary! Hehe, but wait... if Servas wasn't the wolf, then the wolf is still hiding right here with us! Who could it be?! I'm getting goosebumps!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"Since we are now down to three players, the situation is critical. If the Seer is still among us, now is the time to speak. @May, @Sakura, do either of you have any information that can guide us?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're so demanding! I'm just a regular girl, not a magic mirror. I'm not the Seer, but I can tell you that your sudden urgency to find the ""truth"" is starting to feel a bit... desperate. Are you trying to rush us? Hehe!","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, you're being so serious again! It's like you're the teacher and we're in trouble! Hehe! I'm not the Seer either, I'm just a little girl! But @May is right, you're acting super pushy! Are you the wolf?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, @Sakura, my urgency is born from the fact that we are the only ones left. If we execute an innocent person, the werewolf wins immediately. I am simply trying to ensure we don't make a fatal mistake.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, ""ensuring we don't make a mistake"" is exactly what a wolf would say to keep us from voting! You're playing the role of the responsible one a bit too perfectly. It's almost a shame, because your act is actually quite convincing! Hehe!","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@May, you're so sharp! Hehe! It's like a movie where the person who says ""don't panic"" is actually the one who caused the problem! @Misaki, are you trying to trick us into trusting you? I'm getting super suspicious now!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@May, @Sakura, your accusations are based on my desire for logic, not on evidence. If I were the werewolf, I would be trying to divert your attention away from myself, not pushing for a reveal. Please, let us think clearly.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""May"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,May,,"@Misaki, that's the thing—you're not diverting attention, you're trying to control the narrative. It's a classic move! You've played the ""logical"" card since day zero, and now you're using it to make us feel reckless. I'm not buying it! Hehe!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@May, you're so right! Hehe! @Misaki, you're acting like a super-villain who thinks they're the hero! If you're not the wolf, why are you being so bossy? My detective heart says you're the one! I'm voting for you!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
